  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the School for Hearing Impaired Students</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A school for hearing impaired children was established in 2006 with funding from an NGO. Due to lack of funding, this school was closed during the 2019-2020 school year. Thus, a woman from Sokode offered to take over the schooling of these children in a school that was created in the school year 2020 - 2021. In order to achieve the result 3 of its strategic plan 2021-2025, the NGO CAV proposed the project: &quot;Institutional support to the School of Local Initiative for Hearing Impaired Children&quot;.</narrative>
  </description>
